<title>USA: Analog Devices sets 4-for-3 stock split.</title>
<headline>Analog Devices sets 4-for-3 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NORWOOD, Mass. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analog Devices said on Wednesday that its board of directors has approved a four-for-three split of its common stock to be effected in the form of a 33-percent stock dividend. The dividend will be distributed on January 6, 1997 to shareholders of record as of December 16, it added.</p>
